+
+# Summary
+
+Added `applyPatch(document, patch)` to `src/index.ts`, implementing JSON Patch (RFC 6902) with
+add, remove, replace, move, copy and test. It does not mutate its input and throws on invalid
+patches or failed operations. `resolvePointer` was split into `parsePointer` and `walk`, which
+`applyPatch` reuses. Tests (`test/patch.test.ts`, written first) cover the RFC appendix A examples,
+root-path cases, error paths, immutability and prototype safety. Design: dl-002.
